{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060467/block/singleImage/3249420/wm/01M5XHZ5C7RTZ4824FHFHK7K3T.jpeg?updatedAt=1793067418\"/><figcaption>葵涌道3車相撞至少9人傷，昌榮路迴旋處部份行車線已封閉。(《am730》記者攝)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (27 日 ) 上午 9 時許，葵涌道 1013 至 1033 號昌年大廈對開發生交通意外，一輛輕型貨車、一輛中型貨車及一輛小巴相撞，事件中至少有 6 女 3 男受傷 ，其中包括一名孕婦 ，救援人員到場處理傷者傷勢。 運輸署公布，因交通意外，葵涌道 ( 往九龍方向 ) 近昌榮路迴旋處的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通繁忙。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:41.033518+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:16:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:18:20.830468+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:17.325374+00:00","content_hash":"3b71e278e3038a6b4efda5d93e4ea38509635d4811086f610773ad79e106d9e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:41.033518+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}